  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The shop assistant adds that Li Ran always sits at that window to look at her and reserves the seat for half a primeval stone. Qin Yan brothel has eight storeys, and narration says her Gu Master identity can invoke men’s conquering desires. Rumors say it takes almost ten thousand primeval stones to have her for a night. Fang Yuan judges that at that distance he would only see a blur image, and that better peek spots exist if she were the real target.",
      "chapters": [
        282
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_li_ran",
        "loc_qin_yan_brothel",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a great body.",
      "chapters": [
        282
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Someone points her out in the auction house and tells others to ask lady An Yu about a claim that Shang Ya Zi and Fang Zheng competed over the brothel’s number one lady. She is stunned to be involved, sees her pimp wink, understands the rumor can raise her worth, and lowers her head blushing without answering. Most suspicious people take that as confirmation, and she thinks happily that she is going to be famous.",
      "chapters": [
        307
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-rumor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_ya_zi",
        "char_fang_zheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration says people forgot one big winner of that contest, Lady An Yu who shot to fame.",
      "chapters": [
        308
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fame-after-the-bidding",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A servant reports a citywide rumor that Shang Ya Zi and Fang Zheng once competed for Lady An Yu and that Shang Ya Zi lost. Shang Ya Zi calls her that Qin Yan brothel’s prostitute and laughs the claim off as rubbish before the servant moves on to the faked accounts charge.",
      "chapters": [
        310
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
